# Network check test targets (Docker environment)
# Docker has outbound internet access. --cap-add=NET_RAW enables ICMP ping.

# ---- TCP reachable ----
google.com,   443, ok, Google HTTPS
google.com,    80, ok, Google HTTP

# ---- TCP blocked ----
google.com,    22, ng, SSH (should be blocked)
google.com,  9999, ng, Unknown port (should fail)

# ---- Ping only ----
8.8.8.8,        -, ok, Google DNS (ICMP)
